      <div class="modal-body">
        <h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> 2023</p>
      
        <h3>1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
        <p>By using our website and services, you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions, as well as our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must not use our services.</p>
      
        <h3>2. Eligibility</h3>
        <p>Our services are available only to individuals who are at least 18 years old. By using our services, you represent and warrant that you are at least 18 years old and that you have the legal capacity to enter into this agreement.</p>
      
        <h3>3. Account Registration</h3>
        <p>To use certain features of our service, you may be required to register an account. You agree to provide accurate and complete information during the registration process and to keep your account information updated. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account login credentials and for all activities that occur under your account.</p>
      
        <h3>4. Food Ordering</h3>
        <p>The food ordering service on this platform is managed and provided by an employee of <strong>Maya and Me Services</strong>. This service is exclusively available to users in Luisiana, Laguna, Philippines. <strong>Maya and Me Services</strong> oversees the food preparation and delivery processes to ensure quality and timely service.</p>
      
        <h3>5. Dietary Recommendations</h3>
        <p>Our system provides dietary recommendations based on user-provided dietary preferences and restrictions. These recommendations are for informational purposes only and are not a substitute for professional medical advice. Always consult with a healthcare professional before making any dietary changes.</p>
      
        <h3>6. Content-Based Filtering Recommendations</h3>
        <p>Our platform uses content-based filtering to suggest food items that match your preferences. These recommendations are based on the information you provide and may not always be accurate or suitable for your needs. We are not responsible for any decisions you make based on these recommendations.</p>
      
        <h3>7. Pricing and Payment</h3>
        <p>Prices for food items are determined by <strong>Maya and Me Services</strong> and may be subject to change. We strive to provide accurate pricing information, but errors may occur. In such cases, we reserve the right to correct any errors and to cancel any orders that may have been placed with incorrect pricing. Payment for orders is processed through third-party payment providers, and we are not responsible for any issues related to payment processing.</p>
      
        <h3>8. Cancellation and Refunds</h3>
        <p>Cancellation and refund policies are managed directly by <strong>Maya and Me Services</strong>. Please review the specific terms provided at the time of ordering. We are responsible for any disputes or issues related to cancellations or refunds.</p>
      
        <h3>9. User Conduct</h3>
        <p>You agree not to use our services for any unlawful or prohibited activities. You also agree not to interfere with or disrupt the operation of our website or services, or to use our services in any manner that could damage, disable, or impair our systems.</p>
      
        <h3>10. Intellectual Property</h3>
        <p>All content and materials on our website, including text, graphics, logos, and software, are the property of <strong>Maya and Me Services</strong> or our licensors and are protected by intellectual property laws. You may not use, reproduce, or distribute any content or materials without our express written permission.</p>
      
        <h3>11. Limitation of Liability</h3>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, <strong>Maya and Me Services</strong> shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising out of or in connection with your use of our services, including but not limited to damages for loss of profits, goodwill, or other intangible losses.</p>
      
        <h3>12. Indemnification</h3>
        <p>You agree to indemnify and hold <strong>Maya and Me Services</strong>, its officers, directors, employees, and agents harmless from any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, or expenses, including reasonable attorneys' fees, arising out of or in any way connected with your use of our services, your violation of these Terms and Conditions, or your violation of any rights of another.</p>
      
        <h3>13. Data Privacy</h3>
        
        <h4>13.1 Collection of Personal Data</h4>
        <p>We collect personal data from users when they register, place an order, or interact with our website. This data may include your name, contact information, dietary preferences, order history, and payment details.</p>
        
        <h4>13.2 Use of Personal Data</h4>
        <p>The personal data we collect is used to provide, maintain, and improve our services, including processing orders, providing dietary recommendations, and offering personalized content. We may also use your data to communicate with you, respond to inquiries, and send promotional materials.</p>
        
        <h4>13.3 Data Sharing</h4>
        <p>We may share your personal data with third-party service providers, such as payment processors and marketing partners, as necessary to provide our services. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.</p>
        
        <h4>13.4 Data Security</h4>
        <p>We take reasonable measures to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction. However, no internet transmission or electronic storage method is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
        
        <h4>13.5 User Rights</h4>
        <p>You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal data at any time. You may also request that we restrict or stop processing your personal data. To exercise these rights, please contact us at [Contact Information].</p>
      
        <h3>14. Changes to Terms and Conditions</h3>
        <p>We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. Any changes will be effective immediately upon posting on our website. Your continued use of our services after the posting of changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
      
        <h3>15. Governing Law</h3>
        <p>These Terms and Conditions are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Philippines, specifically applicable in Luisiana, Laguna, without regard to its conflict of law principles.</p>
      
        <h3>16. Contact Information</h3>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at:</p>
      
